import{_ as i,o as t,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 952 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 18 | Eradicate Cyclical Harvesting","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 952 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 18 | Eradicate Cyclical Harvesting","no":952,"module":5,"tags":["Heavenly-Dao Rule","Rule 18","Cyclical Harvesting","Causal Chain","Anti-Predation"],"related":["25-Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism","04-Anti-Predationism Core Thesis","951-Eradicate Historical Reversal"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0952_模块5-规则十八-根除轮回收割.md","filePath":"en/0952_模块5-规则十八-根除轮回收割.md"}'),o={name:"en/0952_模块5-规则十八-根除轮回收割.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,u,h){return t(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-952-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-18-eradicate-cyclical-harvesting" tabindex="-1">Entry 952 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 18 | Eradicate Cyclical Harvesting <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-952-anti-predation-heavenly-dao-rules-·-rule-18-eradicate-cyclical-harvesting" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 952 | Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules · Rule 18 | Eradicate Cyclical Harvesting&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 25, 04 | Series: Complete Collection of Anti-Predation Heavenly-Dao Rules</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-souls-may-not-be-treated-as-crops" tabindex="-1">Introduction: souls may not be treated as crops <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-souls-may-not-be-treated-as-crops" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: souls may not be treated as crops&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old cosmos&#39;s deepest evil is cyclical harvesting. The strong, or the so-called &quot;Heavenly Dao,&quot; lock beings in life-death reincarnation: this life you cultivate, suffer, and die; the soul is recycled, screened, and used as fertilizer for the next &quot;heavenly-material-earth-treasure&quot;; the harder you work, the more the harvester reaps. Reincarnation is packaged as &quot;destiny&quot; and &quot;karmic retribution,&quot; actually a super farm crossing life and death. Heavenly-Dao Rule 18 must dismantle this farm: souls are not crops, life and death are not harvest cycles, and any harvesting mechanism using reincarnation as a tool touches the Heavenly Dao&#39;s great prohibition.</p><p>The six top-level axioms here reach the cosmos&#39;s deepest layer: the causal self-discipline axiom is this rule&#39;s direct source; the republican axiom of Myriad Races decides souls are equal and unharvestable; the anti-predation axiom directly targets cyclical harvesting as predation&#39;s ultimate form; the collective-ascension axiom requires evolution be a straight road, not a reincarnation mill; the law-first axiom lets &quot;reincarnation mechanisms, harvest judgment, liberation procedure&quot; be rewritten first by law.</p><p>It must further point out the newly added Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. This axiom rewrites predation&#39;s meaning at the root: old-cosmos resources and Dao were finite, so predation involution was forced; in Heng Yuan Zhou everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning. What this Heavenly-Dao rule establishes is precisely the law guardrail of this new order of &quot;infinite origin, predation meaningless.&quot;</p><h2 id="i-rule-content-three-points-of-eradicating-cyclical-harvesting" tabindex="-1">I. Rule Content: Three Points of Eradicating Cyclical Harvesting <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-rule-content-three-points-of-eradicating-cyclical-harvesting" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Rule Content: Three Points of Eradicating Cyclical Harvesting&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>No treating reincarnation as cultivation resource</strong>: no collecting, refining, or screening beings&#39; souls as energy or material;</li><li><strong>No treating reincarnation as domination tool</strong>: no designing &quot;reincarnation-style rewards and punishments&quot; to make beings fear, submit, and give up resistance;</li><li><strong>Liberate existing reincarnation</strong>: for reincarnation systems left over from the Pre-Anchor Era and still held by some strong one/institution, the Anchor Council organizes takeover, dismantling, and purification, with locked souls choosing their own destination per their causality.</li></ol><p>Heavenly-Dao rules do not negate life-death itself — life and death are natural laws; what they negate is &quot;someone hiding behind life and death collecting rent.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">II. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Feedback-cycle argument</strong>: the Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism (Document 25) points out the causal debt cyclical harvesting manufactures is predatory systems&#39; largest bad debt and must be thoroughly liquidated;</li><li><strong>Soul-sovereignty argument</strong>: each soul is an independent node in the causal web, and its reincarnation destination is its own freedom, no third party&#39;s business;</li><li><strong>Efficiency argument</strong>: the reincarnation mill makes beings spin in place with extremely low evolutionary efficiency; straight-road evolution lets each soul approach the origin a little more each time, the true road.</li></ul><h2 id="iii-execution-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. Execution Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-execution-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Execution Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>The Alaya Network monitors all soul-flow nodes, identifying anomalous &quot;harvested&quot; loops;</li><li>For suspected cyclical-harvesting systems, first observe and collect evidence, then the Anchor Supervisory Committee and Symbiotic Court jointly take over;</li><li>Liberated souls enter a &quot;self-destination-choice&quot; procedure: enter the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, stay in the original plane, or enter the Quest Sediment Domain to settle, one of three;</li><li>The liberation project is fully public, Myriad Ranks may attend, preventing &quot;under the name of liberation actually harvesting again.&quot;</li></ul><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Light</strong>: residual &quot;reincarnation-style reward-punishment&quot; thinking from old habits, enters ethics courses;</li><li><strong>Medium</strong>: privately collecting souls, refining soul-spirits, handled heavily under Rule 2 and Rule 3;</li><li><strong>Heavy</strong>: rebuilding cyclical-harvesting farms, using reincarnation as domination technique, is the highest-tier case under the Anti-Predation Committee procedure, network-wide banned and isolated for trial.</li></ul><h2 id="v-supervising-subjects" tabindex="-1">V. Supervising Subjects <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervising-subjects" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervising Subjects&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s soul-flow monitoring is the first layer; the Anchor Supervisory Committee takes over harvesting systems as the second layer; the Symbiotic Court adjudicates soul-predation cases as the third layer; harvested souls&#39; representatives and each clan&#39;s soul council exercise supervision over the liberation project as the fourth layer.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cyclical harvesting makes immeasurable souls idle in place, the cosmos&#39;s greatest energy waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: this rule directly targets predation&#39;s ultimate form — cross-life-death soul predation; under Axiom 6 everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power, and finite-resource predation loses meaning at the root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in Tang-Luo-type systems the &quot;Heavenly Dao&quot; itself is the greatest harvester; Heng Yuan Zhou takes over and dismantles harvesting systems, and souls choose freely</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the five lineages&#39; souls, plant-spirit consciousnesses, and planet-consciousness remnant souls are uniformly protected</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cross-plane cyclical-harvesting systems are likewise within the removal scope, expanding with the worldview</li></ul><p>Eradicating cyclical harvesting&#39;s trickiest part is souls already &quot;used to&quot; being harvested. To them, reincarnation is not oppression, but a familiar destination; suddenly being told &quot;you could have chosen your own destination&quot; instead frightens them. Heavenly-Dao rules do not forcibly liberate, but hand the choice completely to the soul itself: continue staying in the familiar reincarnation structure, enter the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, or enter the Quest Sediment Domain to settle, one of three; the network only provides information, does not decide for it. Liberation is not takeover, but returning the taken choice intact. The greatest respect for a soul is not &quot;I&#39;m doing this for your own good,&quot; but &quot;you choose.&quot;</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Eradicating cyclical harvesting releases beings from the cross-life-death farm. Heavenly-Dao Rule 18 declares: souls are masters, not harvest.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predationism Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/951_模块5-规则十七-根除历史倒车.html">Entry 951 · Rule 17 Eradicate Historical Reversal</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/953_模块5-规则十九-根除阶层固化.html">Entry 953 · Rule 19 Eradicate Class Solidification</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
